<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:space="preserve" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="恋桜開花前線"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="鳯ちはや (cv. 篠宮沙耶)"/><amll:meta key="album" value="ルチはやアイドルソングCD「ピュアネスラプソディー」"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="547969351"/><amll:meta key="lyricist" value="魁"/><amll:meta key="composer" value="井内舞子"/><amll:meta key="arranger" value="しょうゆ"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle"><text for="line-bd451ed3-2ed2-4d85-b6fe-ee3b0b6a2c93">轻轻地深呼吸</text><text for="line-baad2503-ca98-4824-be7b-568e76b5778b">在上学路上等待着你</text><text for="line-e60be190-5801-4d4f-95a9-f3c5e20f3e8a">还没到吗？就快了吧？</text><text for="line-712a981a-f9ad-4aff-a138-2b68130668e1">不断地看着手表</text><text for="line-e636cb84-8d38-4528-acc7-d3553849e000">每当听见脚步声</text><text for="line-541d7571-85b6-428a-984d-278fe47ffa88">拿着书包的手便颤抖着</text><text for="line-43770f7d-148f-4dd6-a090-cab5f553964c">大树之下</text><text for="line-a3fe14b3-31bd-4ec1-80b8-2151be5acd2b">只要看着眼睛便会心跳不已</text><text for="line-08c85412-d6fa-4b74-8b43-38a8c5026d64">明明想抬起头打招呼的</text><text for="line-1d0f8060-a3cc-472a-98ef-7aee2f1bb642">为什么呢</text><text for="line-ee20e407-bad5-45ce-a0cf-65be3af059cf">平时能做到的事</text><text for="line-1c4e70c9-d1ec-49c5-8b88-1df7e04c642f">渐渐变得笨拙起来</text><text for="line-055c81ea-1f34-4bff-b347-6bd6501cb6e2">骑上自行车出发吧</text><text for="line-11e69a60-3eef-4719-b53e-ef932ad35857">在这路上</text><text for="line-8c4f9ac5-aa86-4315-9306-955c2a63b6b3">开花前线开着恋爱之樱</text><text for="line-85e89632-0ac7-4bb8-a7d8-00ee965c4d93">这份心情</text><text for="line-71069dde-2f1f-4fa2-b6de-71b7a6be05fb">哪一方会先绽放呢</text><text for="line-88070b72-6159-4170-ac6f-3f15614a001e">是只属于我的胜负</text><text for="line-48f16eca-c576-4a97-ab00-8bea61726722">初次相遇是在</text><text for="line-e6b94d3d-45c3-487a-aea7-55eaa24e2b6d">尚且有些寒冷的季节</text><text for="line-62021e0d-6c00-4fac-a652-b46c79c42a56">偶然？必然？</text><text for="line-7500ffa8-c9c8-4afa-bcf4-5ca408c151e7">抑或是命运呢？</text><text for="line-007962b5-e360-4dc5-875d-ddeae6ddad55">老是在吵架</text><text for="line-fa0a3801-be9f-4582-a27b-714b164db8cf">也可以说是冲突</text><text for="line-bf809b22-3ea4-443d-b8e9-6da0312f8786">无法变得坦率</text><text for="line-adecb8ef-2581-4846-a7f8-374e6dcc4faa">却移不开视线</text><text for="line-b1f52f42-b93e-40d5-bbfa-90fa7d53cbb7">总是在意着</text><text for="line-44be572c-b59f-466f-b098-bfb6fa79c1d6">季节一点点流逝</text><text for="line-5e2220d3-883d-4340-84bd-60bd7c840f52">两人的关系</text><text for="line-fbfc4969-e281-4d13-a41b-ae0f3fd5faa7">依旧是原来的距离</text><text for="line-06adb2a1-6483-4915-966b-982a1c627872">即便如此看吧 我和你</text><text for="line-7c060729-eb69-4bb0-ba85-2fb175570bcf">行走之时步幅都是相同</text><text for="line-6fad0713-9fed-4697-9aa3-cd2148baf287">是哪一方在配合着呢</text><text for="line-52c5e26c-a437-4079-9cff-2dac88e69c01">真是不可思议呀</text><text for="line-a13c7204-6047-431d-8d6b-ec1b819aa8e7">用言语无法传达</text><text for="line-e25709b8-7281-44be-8874-597b654d3b7c">这份心意已经到极限了</text><text for="line-3fce0f08-e6bb-4f56-883e-91a9380fb21a">下定决心在樱花绽放之时</text><text for="line-97b2e1ae-47a6-4a17-b94f-8a2390873338">将全部倾吐而出</text><text for="line-121d105c-9f95-44dd-a41e-00f6c9d67dbe">停下自行车整理好羽翼</text><text for="line-9023c146-98d6-49d9-8964-dc94ebf13e87">开花前线已然盛开</text><text for="line-bc536f37-ed3b-40c0-90fd-b5dae36582e4">然而</text><text for="line-d0074c12-7962-418c-b694-2fa9ba177fc0">你的突袭却来临了</text><text for="line-09db7ab0-e3e9-4bd7-a928-2043e791c1c8">太狡猾了呀</text><text for="line-d2330789-33eb-4d4d-89b5-004234ac93a7">两个人一起骑上自行车出发吧</text><text for="line-733498de-cdf0-4388-8eec-2dae25bc8120">开花前线开着恋爱之樱</text><text for="line-71bcee60-641c-4687-9f62-aa725be552f6">绚烂盛放</text><text for="line-96e8d645-b494-4d51-ab68-c47033b8cbe0">这份心情隔着后背</text><text for="line-1935b353-43e0-4ac0-aad6-28c6a4d7eb0e">传达着喜欢你哟</text><text for="85ea117c-953c-4e89-8697-6707069bbd2a">如同含苞般的恋爱</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:55.032"><div><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-bd451ed3-2ed2-4d85-b6fe-ee3b0b6a2c93" itunes:key="line-bd451ed3-2ed2-4d85-b6fe-ee3b0b6a2c93" begin="00:13.412" end="00:17.912"><span begin="00:13.412" end="00:13.852" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">小</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:13.412" end="00:13.632">ち</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:13.632" end="00:13.852">い</span></span></span><span begin="00:13.852" end="00:14.232">さ</span><span begin="00:14.232" end="00:14.432">く</span><span begin="00:14.432" end="00:15.032" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">深</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:14.432" end="00:14.832">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:14.832" end="00:15.032">ん</span></span></span><span begin="00:15.032" end="00:15.212" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">呼</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:15.032" end="00:15.212">こ</span></span></span><span begin="00:15.212" end="00:15.726" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">吸</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:15.212" end="00:15.500">きゅ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:15.500" end="00:15.726">う</span></span></span><span begin="00:15.726" end="00:15.992">し</span><span begin="00:15.992" end="00:16.292">て</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-baad2503-ca98-4824-be7b-568e76b5778b" itunes:key="line-baad2503-ca98-4824-be7b-568e76b5778b" begin="00:16.552" end="00:19.672"><span begin="00:16.552" end="00:17.012" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">通</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:16.552" end="00:16.772">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:16.772" end="00:17.012">う</span></span></span><span begin="00:17.012" end="00:17.572" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">学</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:17.012" end="00:17.372">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:17.372" end="00:17.572">く</span></span></span><span begin="00:17.572" end="00:17.912" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">路</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:17.572" end="00:17.912">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="00:17.952" end="00:18.152">あ</span><span begin="00:18.152" end="00:18.372">な</span><span begin="00:18.372" end="00:18.556">た</span><span begin="00:18.556" end="00:18.751">を</span><span begin="00:18.751" end="00:19.132" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">待</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:18.751" end="00:19.132">ま</span></span></span><span begin="00:19.132" end="00:19.672">つ</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-e60be190-5801-4d4f-95a9-f3c5e20f3e8a" itunes:key="line-e60be190-5801-4d4f-95a9-f3c5e20f3e8a" begin="00:19.912" end="00:23.052"><span begin="00:19.912" end="00:20.132">ま</span><span begin="00:20.132" end="00:20.521">だ</span><span begin="00:20.521" end="00:20.732">か</span><span begin="00:20.732" end="00:21.332">な</span><span begin="00:21.332" end="00:21.479">?</span><span begin="00:21.479" end="00:21.692">も</span><span begin="00:21.692" end="00:21.952">う</span><span begin="00:21.952" end="00:22.272">す</span><span begin="00:22.272" end="00:22.872">ぐ</span><span begin="00:22.872" end="00:23.052">?</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-712a981a-f9ad-4aff-a138-2b68130668e1" itunes:key="line-712a981a-f9ad-4aff-a138-2b68130668e1" begin="00:23.052" end="00:25.612"><span begin="00:23.052" end="00:23.272" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">時</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:23.052" end="00:23.272">と</span></span></span><span begin="00:23.272" end="00:23.672" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">計</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:23.272" end="00:23.452">け</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:23.452" end="00:23.672">い</span></span></span><span begin="00:23.672" end="00:23.812">ば</span><span begin="00:23.812" end="00:24.052">か</span><span begin="00:24.052" end="00:24.412">り</span><span begin="00:24.412" end="00:24.638">を</span><span begin="00:24.638" end="00:25.032" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:24.638" end="00:25.032">み</span></span></span><span begin="00:25.032" end="00:25.252">て</span><span begin="00:25.252" end="00:25.612">る</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-e636cb84-8d38-4528-acc7-d3553849e000" itunes:key="line-e636cb84-8d38-4528-acc7-d3553849e000" begin="00:25.992" end="00:28.852"><span begin="00:25.992" end="00:26.412" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">足</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:25.992" end="00:26.172">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:26.172" end="00:26.412">し</span></span></span><span begin="00:26.412" end="00:27.000" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">音</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:26.412" end="00:26.792">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:26.792" end="00:27.000">と</span></span></span><span begin="00:27.000" end="00:27.372" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">聞</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:27.000" end="00:27.372">き</span></span></span><span begin="00:27.372" end="00:27.592">こ</span><span begin="00:27.592" end="00:27.792">え</span><span begin="00:27.792" end="00:28.252">る</span><span begin="00:28.252" end="00:28.572">た</span><span begin="00:28.572" end="00:28.852">び</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-541d7571-85b6-428a-984d-278fe47ffa88" itunes:key="line